WEBVTT

00:00:02.310 --> 00:00:08.190
Don't touch it, don't touch it
sawaranaide sawaranaide yawarakana ai de

00:00:08.190 --> 00:00:11.740
Watch over it softly, with sweet love
funwari to mimamottete ne

00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:14.280
All right, all right, okay, okay?
oorai oorai OK OK?

00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:32.590
Even though the third try went bad
sandome no shoujiki ga bacchiri shippai shitemo

00:00:32.590 --> 00:00:38.100
the Earth is still turning, round and round!
soredemo chikyuu wa mawatteru guru guru!

00:00:38.510 --> 00:00:43.810
I'm honest to my desire and innocently greedy
yokubou ni shoujiki de mujaki ni donyoku desu

00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:48.900
You just realized that? How slow...
imagoro kizuita no? osoi yo nee

00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:55.950
Please give me all the goodies that reflect in my eyes
kono me ni utsuru suteki wo zeenbu kudasai

00:00:55.950 --> 00:01:01.200
Being able to say what you like is a blessing
sukina mono wo suki to ieru shi-a-wa-se

00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:07.000
Don't drop it, don't drop it, scoop it with both hands
otosanaide otosanaide ryoute de sukutte

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:10.420
Surround it with a lot of love
ookime no ai de tsutsunde

00:01:10.420 --> 00:01:13.090
Thank you, thank you, berry much
sankyuu sankyuu berry macchi

00:01:13.090 --> 00:01:19.970
Round, sour, gentle, absent-minded girls...
maarukutte suppakutte fuwari bonyari onna no ko

00:01:19.970 --> 00:01:25.440
If we make a pinky-promise I'll never let go
yubikiri shichatta nara hanarenaizo

00:01:25.440 --> 00:01:28.350
Strawberry, berry, berry
ichigo berry berry

00:01:28.350 --> 00:01:31.360
I cried, furry furry
naita furry furry

00:01:31.360 --> 00:01:34.240
That's impossible, impossible
sore wa murry murry

00:01:34.240 --> 00:01:37.110
Ah, give me a break - berry berry!
akkan bee berry berry!

00:01:43.490 --> 00:01:46.330
You aren't allowed to eat it!

00:01:46.330 --> 00:01:48.460
What's the big deal? It's just a pudding.

00:01:48.460 --> 00:01:49.750
No.

00:01:49.750 --> 00:01:52.130
I'm going to enjoy it after dinner.

00:01:52.130 --> 00:01:53.630
Tsk, stingy.

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:56.260
Chi-chan is so childish.

00:01:56.260 --> 00:01:59.430
It's just a confection. Let her have a bite.

00:01:59.430 --> 00:02:03.140
No, that pudding is special.

00:02:03.140 --> 00:02:07.690
Whenever a new one comes out, Chika-chan has to study its recipe.

00:02:07.690 --> 00:02:10.770
Why don't you just eat and study it now, then?

00:02:10.770 --> 00:02:13.360
Because I only got one.

00:02:13.360 --> 00:02:15.570
What does that pudding look like?

00:02:15.990 --> 00:02:21.740
Let's see... It's half mango and half milk pudding.

00:02:21.740 --> 00:02:26.040
On top of it, they put in fruit like strawberries and pineapple.

00:02:26.330 --> 00:02:30.960
I know that one. It has custard cream in it. I saw it at a convenience store.

00:02:30.960 --> 00:02:31.670
That's the one.

00:02:32.130 --> 00:02:34.130
It sounds delicious.

00:02:34.130 --> 00:02:35.510
All right, guys.

00:02:36.130 --> 00:02:37.720
Let's play hide-and-seek.

00:02:38.840 --> 00:02:40.470
Hide-and-seek?

00:02:40.470 --> 00:02:43.010
I will be the oni.

00:02:44.010 --> 00:02:47.180
All right, all right. Everyone, go hide.

00:02:51.810 --> 00:02:54.270
You guys ready?

00:02:55.530 --> 00:02:59.070
I trust you, Micchan.

00:02:59.070 --> 00:03:01.070
I am ready.

00:03:01.070 --> 00:03:03.410
I'm ready.

00:03:03.410 --> 00:03:09.370
After all, she wouldn't go that far. She just wanted to play hide-and-seek.

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:12.000
I trust you, Micchan.

00:03:12.920 --> 00:03:15.590
But I will watch it, just in case.

00:03:16.210 --> 00:03:18.340
I'm ready.

00:03:26.810 --> 00:03:28.310
Hold it right there!

00:03:29.180 --> 00:03:30.980
You scared me.

00:03:31.520 --> 00:03:34.650
Are you serious? You really did plan to eat it!

00:03:34.650 --> 00:03:36.520
Ah, I found you.

00:03:36.520 --> 00:03:39.030
Geez, even though I trusted you.

00:03:39.030 --> 00:03:40.450
I hate you.

00:03:45.030 --> 00:03:46.910
W-What's so funny?

00:03:49.910 --> 00:03:52.170
You thought too little of me, Chi-chan.

00:03:52.170 --> 00:03:54.290
I thought I would be caught...

00:03:55.590 --> 00:03:59.010
And so, I bought the same pudding!

00:03:59.880 --> 00:04:01.510
Eat that one, then.

00:04:02.260 --> 00:04:05.470
Always.

00:04:05.470 --> 00:04:07.260
Onee-chan!
Always.

00:04:07.260 --> 00:04:11.230
Didn't I tell you not to leave the ashtray in weird places?

00:04:12.140 --> 00:04:16.480
You will be scolded by Dad again for throwing cigarette butts on the ground.

00:04:24.820 --> 00:04:29.290
It even says, "You shouldn't smoke too much" on the cigarette box.

00:04:30.240 --> 00:04:32.620
You got tricked, Chi.

00:04:32.620 --> 00:04:35.580
I didn't light the cigarette.

00:04:40.170 --> 00:04:42.170
Yay! Yay!

00:04:42.380 --> 00:04:44.430
Chi!

00:04:56.270 --> 00:04:59.320
The cat... costume again.

00:05:01.110 --> 00:05:03.320
What happened, Matsuri-chan?

00:05:03.320 --> 00:05:07.030
Ah, Miu-chan gave this to me the other day.

00:05:07.030 --> 00:05:11.700
Wow! That outfit suits you really well after all, Matsuri-chan.

00:05:11.700 --> 00:05:13.700
R-Really?

00:05:13.700 --> 00:05:15.410
Really.

00:05:15.410 --> 00:05:18.790
But it's a little embarrassing after all.

00:05:18.790 --> 00:05:19.630
Don't take it off!

00:05:20.840 --> 00:05:22.000
E-Eh?

00:05:27.390 --> 00:05:29.010
How cute.

00:05:29.010 --> 00:05:31.010
Yeah, she's cute.

00:05:31.600 --> 00:05:33.680
Hey, Matsuri-chan, try to say "meow."

00:05:33.680 --> 00:05:35.020
Yeah, try.

00:05:35.020 --> 00:05:36.980
M-Meow.

00:05:37.810 --> 00:05:39.440
So cute.

00:05:39.440 --> 00:05:40.480
It suits you.

00:05:40.480 --> 00:05:41.320
So cute.

00:05:41.320 --> 00:05:43.070
How nice, Matsuri-chan.

00:05:57.670 --> 00:05:58.420
Suits me?

00:05:59.130 --> 00:06:02.920
Nah, you already have twin tails... The balance is bad.

00:06:02.920 --> 00:06:06.380
Ah, wouldn't that suit Ana-chan more?

00:06:06.380 --> 00:06:07.010
Eh?

00:06:07.010 --> 00:06:08.380
Ah, sounds good.

00:06:08.970 --> 00:06:10.390
Lend it to me for a bit.

00:06:11.470 --> 00:06:15.180
Whoa, it fits perfectly.

00:06:15.180 --> 00:06:16.810
It suits you very well.

00:06:16.810 --> 00:06:18.690
Ana-chan, you're cute.

00:06:18.690 --> 00:06:20.150
Really?

00:06:20.560 --> 00:06:22.150
You're cute.

00:06:22.150 --> 00:06:24.030
You should just take it.

00:06:24.780 --> 00:06:25.900
Give it back!

00:06:30.410 --> 00:06:32.950
The bunny will die if it feels lonely.

00:06:50.720 --> 00:06:53.300
Onee-chan, Micchan got jealous, didn't she?

00:06:53.300 --> 00:06:54.140
Here, Ana-chan, your bunny ears.

00:06:54.140 --> 00:06:56.520
She's not listening...
Here, Ana-chan, your bunny ears.

00:07:01.560 --> 00:07:04.520
Ana-chan, you look cute with that after all.

00:07:04.520 --> 00:07:07.740
My, you're cute with that, too.

00:07:08.190 --> 00:07:09.320
Roar!

00:07:09.320 --> 00:07:09.700
What?!

00:07:12.870 --> 00:07:15.280
Roar!

00:07:15.280 --> 00:07:18.580
The strong one wins in the end!

00:07:23.500 --> 00:07:25.420
Dracula!

00:07:25.420 --> 00:07:27.510
Your house really has everything.

00:07:29.470 --> 00:07:31.470
Give me your blood!

00:07:33.800 --> 00:07:34.970
Wait...

00:07:47.900 --> 00:07:50.900
Most definitely, young human's blood tastes good.

00:07:50.900 --> 00:07:52.240
It has a skin caring effect.

00:07:52.240 --> 00:07:54.160
That's mean, Miu-chan.

00:07:54.160 --> 00:07:56.330
She must have a screw loose.

00:07:58.200 --> 00:08:00.540
You're next.

00:08:00.540 --> 00:08:02.370
Whoa...

00:08:04.880 --> 00:08:07.040
Ah. Nah, it's an old woman.

00:08:07.040 --> 00:08:10.300
Hey, suck me. I'm still a female college student.

00:08:15.720 --> 00:08:17.640
Look at this, you Dracula!

00:08:25.600 --> 00:08:27.190
It's useless!

00:08:28.320 --> 00:08:30.400
Look, it's a bit distorted here.

00:08:31.360 --> 00:08:32.570
How picky.

00:08:33.030 --> 00:08:34.360
All right, if that's the case...

00:08:39.540 --> 00:08:41.870
How about this?

00:08:54.380 --> 00:08:55.970
Onee-chan?

00:08:56.640 --> 00:08:59.560
Did you wash your sneakers with the laundry again?

00:09:00.470 --> 00:09:04.310
Didn't I tell you I was washing my handkerchief? Isn't that dirty?

00:09:04.310 --> 00:09:07.150
Didn't you wash bread before, too?

00:09:07.150 --> 00:09:11.860
My favorite shirt was covered with bread crumbs. It was terrible.

00:09:11.860 --> 00:09:13.070
Right?

00:09:13.900 --> 00:09:16.450
I told you many times, didn't I?

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:19.950
Micchan sneaked that into my pocket.

00:09:44.980 --> 00:09:45.850
Matsuri-chan!

00:09:46.270 --> 00:09:48.850
She banged her little toe against the table leg.

00:09:50.020 --> 00:09:51.820
The little toe... That must hurt.

00:09:55.400 --> 00:09:57.660
It's okay. Leave it to me, Matsuri-chan.

00:10:09.330 --> 00:10:12.920
Now, concentrate on the pain here, Matsuri-chan.

00:10:19.220 --> 00:10:22.050
Inhale. Inhale. Exhale.

00:10:22.050 --> 00:10:23.600
You, stand back.

00:10:31.770 --> 00:10:33.690
Junior high first year's mathematics?

00:10:38.900 --> 00:10:39.610
Eh?

00:10:40.700 --> 00:10:43.490
I bought the wrong one.

00:10:43.490 --> 00:10:47.200
I planned to study English together with Ana-chan...

00:10:47.200 --> 00:10:50.620
How did you buy the wrong one, Matsuri-chan?

00:10:51.580 --> 00:10:53.250
What should I do?

00:10:53.790 --> 00:10:56.090
It's okay. Leave it to me, Matsuri-chan.

00:10:59.800 --> 00:11:00.470
Here.

00:11:03.010 --> 00:11:05.930
I'm a junior college student, for God's sake.

00:11:05.930 --> 00:11:09.100
Humph, junior college student, you said?

00:11:09.100 --> 00:11:13.610
Your knowledge is just at this level, isn't it?

00:11:22.070 --> 00:11:25.410
Nah, I haven't done anything yet.

00:11:26.450 --> 00:11:30.410
Well, I thought I would be beaten up, so I might as well just collapse first.

00:11:30.410 --> 00:11:31.500
You know... One way or another.

00:11:32.880 --> 00:11:35.340
Let's go to the bookstore in a little while.

00:11:36.340 --> 00:11:38.170
They will probably exchange it for you.

00:11:38.170 --> 00:11:41.260
Okay. Thank you, Onee-chan.

00:11:41.880 --> 00:11:46.640
Eh? Junior high first year students are doing some complicated stuff nowadays.

00:11:49.100 --> 00:11:51.100
What's the other book?

00:11:51.100 --> 00:11:52.600
Hold on. This one.

00:11:54.860 --> 00:11:58.440
That one... is not a mistake, right?

00:11:58.440 --> 00:12:00.570
No, it's right.

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:04.620
Wanwan korokoro?

00:12:04.620 --> 00:12:05.280
Yeah.

00:12:15.790 --> 00:12:17.040
Matsuri-chan.

00:12:21.380 --> 00:12:22.970
Matsuri-chan.

00:12:26.140 --> 00:12:27.350
Hey.

00:12:32.690 --> 00:12:34.400
Hey.

00:12:36.190 --> 00:12:37.310
Say...

00:12:37.690 --> 00:12:42.070
Seeing this reminds me why I'm always worried.

00:12:42.070 --> 00:12:43.740
Eh? What?

00:12:44.740 --> 00:12:49.290
You know, whether Matsuri-chan can properly live on hereafter.

00:12:51.080 --> 00:12:53.750
Well, she can live on just fine, can't she?

00:13:00.250 --> 00:13:03.720
Hey, Ana-chan. What's wrong with Matsuri-chan today?

00:13:04.050 --> 00:13:07.470
Eh? She's the same as usual.

00:13:08.470 --> 00:13:11.560
In the morning, she fell down the stairs.

00:13:13.890 --> 00:13:16.230
During the Japanese language lesson...

00:13:16.230 --> 00:13:19.320
when she tried to pick up the pencil that she dropped...

00:13:19.320 --> 00:13:21.360
she hit her head.

00:13:22.190 --> 00:13:24.110
My glasses... Glasses...

00:13:24.860 --> 00:13:29.160
When we were swimming, I stayed with her to practice flutter kicking.

00:13:30.080 --> 00:13:33.120
She was very slow at changing, too.

00:13:34.540 --> 00:13:40.380
After that, she hasn't been feeling well, so she slept in the nurse's office during break.

00:13:41.500 --> 00:13:45.760
She was still eating her lunch even after lunch break.

00:13:46.380 --> 00:13:50.720
After that, when we were heading home, she tripped at the shoe rack...

00:13:54.430 --> 00:13:56.730
That's... "as usual."

00:13:56.730 --> 00:13:58.560
As usual.

00:13:58.560 --> 00:14:02.400
Sigh... Nah, this isn't a comic.

00:14:02.400 --> 00:14:04.820
Ana-chan is having a tough time, too.

00:14:06.360 --> 00:14:11.450
So, after hearing that, can you still say Matsuri-chan will be okay?

00:14:12.790 --> 00:14:15.120
I'm getting a little worried.

00:14:19.170 --> 00:14:20.130
That's why!

00:14:20.750 --> 00:14:25.300
I think it is our mission to correct her right away.

00:14:25.300 --> 00:14:27.170
We should do it while my hair is still black.

00:14:27.170 --> 00:14:28.800
Your hair is brown.

00:14:29.590 --> 00:14:30.970
I said your hair was brown.

00:14:30.970 --> 00:14:34.930
But I don't think it's that easy to fix.

00:14:38.060 --> 00:14:39.560
Hey, hey, Onee-chan.

00:14:41.560 --> 00:14:45.860
We're going to correct Matsuri-chan right now. Give us a hand, too.

00:14:48.780 --> 00:14:51.490
Not now, leave it till later.

00:14:51.490 --> 00:14:53.370
Ah? Why?

00:14:53.370 --> 00:14:57.290
Look at Matsuri-chan, that happy-looking face of hers.

00:15:02.840 --> 00:15:05.170
It's soothing.

00:15:06.710 --> 00:15:08.920
You're at the age of wanting to be soothed, eh?

00:15:09.680 --> 00:15:11.590
I will soothe you, then.

00:15:12.430 --> 00:15:14.180
You can't soothe me.

00:15:16.140 --> 00:15:17.890
I'm going to do the soothing pose.

00:15:21.520 --> 00:15:23.520
It doesn't soothe me.

00:15:24.150 --> 00:15:26.940
Besides, no one wants to marry you.

00:15:27.610 --> 00:15:28.860
You're right.

00:15:32.360 --> 00:15:35.280
Seems like we struck Chi's weak spot again.

00:15:45.670 --> 00:15:53.430
One day, two puppies, Wan and Koro, found an acorn in the field where they were playing.

00:15:55.260 --> 00:15:59.850
Wan put his ears to the acorn and listened to the sound.

00:16:00.350 --> 00:16:02.770
He didn't hear anything.

00:16:02.770 --> 00:16:06.150
Koro tried to lick the acorn.

00:16:06.150 --> 00:16:08.480
It tasted a bit sour.

00:16:09.070 --> 00:16:13.610
There was another acorn at the bottom of a big tree.

00:16:13.610 --> 00:16:16.660
Wan had one, Koro had one, too...

00:16:16.660 --> 00:16:21.500
It was just then that Satake paid a home visit, and said this in Watanabe Atsushi's voice:

00:16:21.500 --> 00:16:24.460
"This is a fine acorn. If you would excuse me then."

00:16:24.460 --> 00:16:26.790
And then he ate the acorn with a crunching sound.

00:16:26.790 --> 00:16:30.960
His stomach grew rapidly, and he walked away, skipping steps.

00:16:30.960 --> 00:16:33.680
That's not written in there, Micchan.

00:16:33.680 --> 00:16:36.760
Well then, I'm going first on my bike.

00:16:37.470 --> 00:16:41.350
Ana-chan, you walked here today, right? I can give you a ride on my back seat.

00:16:41.350 --> 00:16:43.230
Eh? Is that okay?

00:16:43.230 --> 00:16:46.400
Don't ride along the riverside, it's dangerous with two people.

00:16:46.400 --> 00:16:48.020
Yeah, I know.

00:16:48.610 --> 00:16:51.110
Matsuri-chan, you sit on my back then.

00:16:51.530 --> 00:16:55.280
I'm okay by myself. I came by bicycle today.

00:17:00.370 --> 00:17:02.000
What's wrong, everyone?

00:17:08.380 --> 00:17:08.920
Eh?

00:17:14.840 --> 00:17:18.510
Excuse me, it seems we bought the wrong one.

00:17:22.140 --> 00:17:25.140
Aren't you glad? They exchanged it for you right away.

00:17:25.140 --> 00:17:27.940
Yeah, it's because Onee-chan came with us.

00:17:28.860 --> 00:17:30.320
Where is Nobu-neechan?

00:17:30.320 --> 00:17:31.570
She went to work.

00:17:31.980 --> 00:17:33.490
Is it the family restaurant again?

00:17:33.490 --> 00:17:35.280
Nah, she's forbidden to enter there.

00:17:38.370 --> 00:17:40.950
I'm getting thirsty.

00:17:40.950 --> 00:17:41.660
Yeah.

00:17:42.740 --> 00:17:44.200
Let's go to the family restaurant then.

00:17:45.660 --> 00:17:48.000
Micchan, have you brought any money with you?

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:50.380
No. What about it?

00:17:50.380 --> 00:17:53.300
We can't go without money.

00:17:53.300 --> 00:17:55.590
Eh? Really?

00:17:59.050 --> 00:18:00.220
Let's go home then.

00:18:00.220 --> 00:18:00.970
Yeah.

00:18:06.770 --> 00:18:09.810
I do have a little money with me.

00:18:09.810 --> 00:18:14.280
Eh? I have 200 yen, let's go buy some juice.

00:18:14.280 --> 00:18:16.150
Treat me.

00:18:16.150 --> 00:18:18.280
It's a Dutch treat, Micchan.

00:18:18.280 --> 00:18:19.990
Yeah, yeah.

00:18:19.990 --> 00:18:21.830
Wait for me!

00:18:32.630 --> 00:18:38.550
Today's sunset is especially beautiful...

00:18:40.930 --> 00:18:42.640
Matsuri-chan.

00:18:45.390 --> 00:18:46.220
Ouch.

00:18:47.230 --> 00:18:49.350
Hey, what the heck are you doing?

00:18:49.350 --> 00:18:52.150
It's hot. Something bit me.

00:18:52.150 --> 00:18:54.150
Geez, stop it, Micchan.

00:18:54.150 --> 00:18:56.740
She shot you with a rubber band.

00:18:56.740 --> 00:18:58.280
Get back at her, Matsuri-chan.

00:18:58.280 --> 00:18:59.950
E-Eh?

00:19:01.530 --> 00:19:02.660
Do it.

00:19:03.780 --> 00:19:06.240
You shouldn't have done that, Miu-chan.

00:19:07.330 --> 00:19:09.790
You don't have the courage to hurt others...

00:19:12.880 --> 00:19:15.500
My dress...

00:19:15.500 --> 00:19:17.170
I'm going to get a towel.

00:19:18.510 --> 00:19:20.880
My nose... My nose...

00:19:20.880 --> 00:19:22.680
I-I'm sorry, Miu-chan.

00:19:22.680 --> 00:19:24.260
I didn't really mean to...

00:19:24.680 --> 00:19:26.180
Good job, Matsuri-chan.

00:19:26.180 --> 00:19:27.220
Keep going.

00:19:27.220 --> 00:19:28.020
Eh?

00:19:28.020 --> 00:19:31.940
That's right. Now is the time to avenge yourself for all those years.

00:19:31.940 --> 00:19:33.690
It's retribution.

00:19:33.690 --> 00:19:35.020
E-Eh?

00:19:35.980 --> 00:19:37.070
Unforgivable!

00:19:37.070 --> 00:19:39.070
Take this kick of punishment!

00:19:39.070 --> 00:19:41.070
Eh? Stop it!

00:19:41.410 --> 00:19:42.700
Nogueira!

00:19:44.530 --> 00:19:46.030
Your knee... Your knee...

00:19:46.030 --> 00:19:48.040
Ah, sorry, Miu-chan.
Your knee... Your knee...

00:19:48.040 --> 00:19:50.500
You knocked her shin beautifully with your knee...

00:19:50.500 --> 00:19:53.460
My, my... Nogueira uses his joints to attack.

00:19:54.040 --> 00:19:56.460
Damn you, I will never forgive you!

00:19:56.460 --> 00:19:58.800
No, stop it!

00:19:58.800 --> 00:20:01.380
Rolling headbutt!

00:20:01.680 --> 00:20:04.140
Rolling...

00:20:06.680 --> 00:20:08.350
I'm dizzy.

00:20:08.350 --> 00:20:10.600
Geez, you're annoying, Miu-san.

00:20:11.690 --> 00:20:14.480
All right, Micchan, jump on me.

00:20:14.480 --> 00:20:17.770
What? You love me after all?

00:20:20.490 --> 00:20:23.240
Chi-chan, I love you...

00:20:27.910 --> 00:20:29.200
Look, Matsuri-chan.

00:20:29.870 --> 00:20:34.620
I have taken 127 points of damage from the rubber band and your knee,

00:20:34.620 --> 00:20:36.880
but as you can see, I'm still all lively.

00:20:36.880 --> 00:20:38.670
Eh? What?

00:20:38.670 --> 00:20:41.210
You have taken 127 points, eh?

00:20:41.210 --> 00:20:43.720
Micchan, how much HP do you have?

00:20:47.550 --> 00:20:49.260
What is HP?

00:20:49.260 --> 00:20:51.100
What was that number then?

00:20:51.640 --> 00:20:53.730
First of all, let's increase your HP.

00:20:53.730 --> 00:20:55.310
So, it's HP after all.

00:20:55.770 --> 00:20:58.480
Matsuri-chan, your HP is two right now.

00:20:58.480 --> 00:21:00.400
Eh? Only two?

00:21:00.940 --> 00:21:03.700
Even though you said that all of a sudden...

00:21:04.150 --> 00:21:06.450
W-What should I do?

00:21:06.950 --> 00:21:08.490
First of all...

00:21:09.080 --> 00:21:13.460
Go to the garden and find some nuts or fallen seeds to eat.

00:21:13.460 --> 00:21:14.540
Eh?

00:21:14.540 --> 00:21:16.790
You've played too many games, Miu-san.

00:21:17.420 --> 00:21:19.920
Can you do push-ups, Matsuri-chan?

00:21:19.920 --> 00:21:20.500
Eh?

00:21:29.930 --> 00:21:31.180
How about sit-ups?

00:21:39.900 --> 00:21:40.860
All right.

00:21:40.860 --> 00:21:42.070
Go to the hospital.

00:21:42.070 --> 00:21:43.900
Nah, I say...

00:21:43.900 --> 00:21:46.780
How come it became such a fuss?

00:21:46.780 --> 00:21:54.750
We're trying to fix Matsuri-chan so that she can properly live on by herself even if we're gone.

00:21:54.750 --> 00:21:56.710
Ah, is that so?

00:21:57.460 --> 00:21:58.580
And your voice!

00:21:58.580 --> 00:22:00.540
Your voice is too small and tiny!

00:22:00.540 --> 00:22:03.760
U-Um... Really?

00:22:03.760 --> 00:22:08.340
I think it will be better for you to go like "Hey!" in a loud voice.

00:22:08.340 --> 00:22:09.390
Okay.

00:22:09.390 --> 00:22:10.930
Hey, hey...

00:22:10.930 --> 00:22:13.770
Don't teach Matsuri-chan weird stuff.

00:22:13.770 --> 00:22:16.430
Give it a try. Hey!

00:22:17.600 --> 00:22:19.400
H-Hey!

00:22:20.150 --> 00:22:21.610
Hey!

00:22:22.070 --> 00:22:23.320
Hey!

00:22:23.860 --> 00:22:27.320
Take this!

00:22:27.320 --> 00:22:29.200
Chatterbox!

00:22:29.200 --> 00:22:31.780
Ch-Chatterbox...?

00:22:31.780 --> 00:22:34.370
!@#$%^&*

00:22:34.370 --> 00:22:36.370
Shut up, Micchan.

00:22:36.370 --> 00:22:37.660
!@#$%...

00:22:37.660 --> 00:22:40.170
Matsuri-chan, you don't need to say it...

00:22:40.170 --> 00:22:46.090
But, if everyone is gone... I...

00:22:46.090 --> 00:22:49.300
It's true that even if only I were gone...

00:22:49.300 --> 00:22:52.640
I don't think she would be able to make it through her school life.

00:22:53.720 --> 00:22:55.140
See?

00:22:55.470 --> 00:23:00.150
Even so, asking her to be independent all of a sudden... Right?

00:23:00.150 --> 00:23:03.400
Shouldn't we start with her appearance instead after all?

00:23:03.400 --> 00:23:05.820
It takes time to change the content.

00:23:05.820 --> 00:23:06.860
Appearance, eh?

00:23:06.860 --> 00:23:11.570
In short, as long as she has a look that can overwhelm the people around her, it's good enough.

00:23:14.330 --> 00:23:16.200
Okay, line up!

00:23:26.380 --> 00:23:29.630
Now, a word from the leader, please.

00:23:29.630 --> 00:23:31.640
Eh? Erm...

00:23:31.640 --> 00:23:34.350
Eh? W-What should I say...

00:23:34.350 --> 00:23:38.310
See, Matsuri-chan is troubled.

00:23:38.640 --> 00:23:40.480
Eh... Erm...

00:23:41.600 --> 00:23:43.730
Y-Yo!

00:23:48.320 --> 00:23:50.070
All okay!

00:23:50.070 --> 00:23:51.450
What is?

00:24:00.000 --> 00:24:10.670
I can't hear anything from the sky as it turns madder red
nanimo kikoenai sora no iro wa akane

00:24:11.090 --> 00:24:20.770
The memories are always soft to the touch
kioku wa itsumo yasashii tezawari

00:24:20.770 --> 00:24:29.940
It gently gives me a smile
sotto hohoemi wo kureru

00:24:29.940 --> 00:24:39.870
I flew a paper airplane just now, didn't I?
kamihikouki sakki tobashita deshou

00:24:40.410 --> 00:24:47.750
An ephemeral, parabola
hakanasugiru houbutsusen

00:24:48.210 --> 00:24:50.710
It's fluffy
furirura

00:24:50.880 --> 00:25:00.810
Though I've grown up without noticing it
itsunomanika otona ni natte takedo

00:25:01.220 --> 00:25:06.520
I waited for the rain to stop all this time
machibouketa ameagari

00:25:06.560 --> 00:25:21.200
The smell after the rain was surprisingly soft
odoroku hodo yasashii nioi ga shiteta

00:25:26.120 --> 00:25:31.210
Everyday.
Next
